        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Based on the popular cartoon series, Rocky and Bullwinkle is an Xbox LIVE Arcade exclusive game. Rocky and Bullwinkle is a party video game compilation developed by Zen Studios for the Xbox Live Arcade service, based on characters and scenes from The Adventures of Rocky and Bullwinkle and Friends. It was released in 2008, marking the first game based on the property since Rocky & Bullwinkle's Know-It-All Quiz Game in 1998.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Basado en la popular serie de dibujos animados, Rocky and Bullwinkle es un juego exclusivo de Xbox LIVE Arcade. Es una recopilación de juegos para fiestas desarrollada por Zen Studios para el servicio Xbox Live Arcade, basada en personajes y escenas de The Adventures of Rocky and Bullwinkle and Friends. Se lanzó en 2008 y es el primer juego basado en la franquicia desde Rocky & Bullwinkle's Know-It-All Quiz Game, de 1998.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
